<title>USA: Banknorth Q3 shr up to $0.87.</title>
<headline>Banknorth Q3 shr up to $0.87.</headline>
<dateline>BURLINGTON, Va. 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.87		    $0.86</p>
<p> Net			  6,813		    5,826</p>
<p> Avg shrs		   7,827		    6,804</p>
<p>	  Nine MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr			  $2.40		    $2.43</p>
<p> Net			 18,357		   16,542</p>
<p> Avg shrs		   7,662		    6,804</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)  </p>
<p>NOTE: Net interest income was $28.3 million for the three months ended September 30, an increase of $6.8 million, or 31.8 percent, over the third quarter 1995. The provision for loan losses in the third quarter 1996 was $1.5 million, $375,000 higher than in the third quarter 1995.</p>
<p>Full company name is Banknorth Group Inc.</p>
